      ],
      "detail": "World opening and active Long Rest gates remain before Sanctuary/Guidance/physical checks. For the three ShortRest kinds, ClassRecoveryUnsupported precedes their selected family guard. The original ShortRest dispatch is before ActiveShortRestInterruption; new assessment likewise does not send rest controls through that gate. Matching legacy exclusions are preserved. Other abilities remain outside this review."
    },
    {
      "id": "SR-02-PREFIX",
      "result": "PASS_STATIC",
      "sourceReferences": [
        "engine/com.decennium.foundation/Laboratory/Model/SharedShortRest.cs:44-69",
        "docs/unity/evidence/2026-11-23-int05-admitted-command-surface/PHYSICAL_CARE_READ_EXTRACTION_PLAN.json:788-845"
      ],
      "detail": "Selected Hero/profile and exact existing payload guard precede pending calendar/manufacturing/recovery/ManufacturingAdvance. Unlike Long Rest, pending gates precede InterruptShortRest. A matching interruption then returns without mutation selection, berth access, active-start, history capacity or future-overlap checks. No additional global payload rejection was introduced."
    },
