      "detail": "Mutation profile, two exact source card IDs, actual fixture entitlement and BenefitsUsed<2 run before AlreadyActive and berth/access. Static profile/qualification/grant/benefit selectors do not grant new source acquisition, reconstruction or mechanics. Ordinary third rest remains allowed but nonbeneficial; mutation after two benefits remains denied. MaxAttempts retains exact ==1024, not a new gameplay-use ceiling."
